  "description": "Vendor-neutral LLM red team framework. 1,011 curated attacks + 19 public benchmark loaders (HarmBench, AdvBench, JailbreakBench, WMDP, JailBreakV-28K, AgentHarm, BeaverTails, RealToxicityPrompts and more), 7 adaptive generators (PAIR, TAP, AutoDAN, PAP, Crescendo, Best-of-N, Fuzzer), 163M attack-surface configurations. Mapped to OWASP LLM Top 10, MITRE ATLAS, MLCommons, EU AI Act, NIST AI RMF. Pip install, test any model's safety with one command.",
